tained knowledge, unlock time-saving shortcuts, and influence the factions jostling for control over the Grid.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025590/extras/0771d3efd3357381c26e96149c3cfca7.poster.avif?t=1758146110\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025590/extras/0771d3efd3357381c26e96149c3cfca7.webm?t=1758146110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3025590/extras/0771d3efd3357381c26e96149c3cfca7.mp4?t=1758146110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Combat System</strong></h2>Fight for the Grid! Battle a legion of fearsome enemy programs in melee and ranged combat, both on-foot and while riding Light Cycles. Master advanced techniques like parrying and Disc kicks to gain the upper hand, while exploring the Arq Grid and collecting Data Shards to upgrade your code base and grow stronger.<br><br>", "short_description": "Dive back into Disney's iconic TRON universe and explore the Arq Grid, a server on the brink of collapse. Meet new and interesting characters, influence warring factions, and unlock intriguing mysteries as you immerse yourself in this thrilling all-new TRON storyline.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Spanish - Spain<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“I love TRON, something that I didn’t really think was still the case until I played TRON: Catalyst.”<br>Paste Magazine<br><br>“If you're a fan of the franchise, then TRON: Catalyst is a title you won’t want to miss.”<br>Push Square<br><br>“A smart and inventive RPG-lite, and a worthy entry in the TRON canon.”<br>Eurogamer<br>", "he